### Frontend (HTML / CSS / Vanilla JS)

#### [MODIFY] [frontend/app.js](file:///c:/Users/LEGION/GIT/vox-vision-ai/frontend/app.js)
- Implement a `WebSocketManager` class:
  - Establishes connection to `ws://host/ws/chat`.
  - Handles `onopen`, `onmessage`, `onerror`, and `onclose`.
  - Auto-reconnects using backoff delay (1s, 2s, 4s, up to 10s max) when connection drops.
  - Updates UI header connection status pill (`Connected (WS)`, `Reconnecting...`, `Disconnected`).
  - Sends user chat messages over WebSocket.
  - Handles incoming response messages to render assistant chat bubbles.

#### [MODIFY] [frontend/index.html](file:///c:/Users/LEGION/GIT/vox-vision-ai/frontend/index.html)
