## Verification Plan

### Automated & Endpoint Verification
- Run backend server on `127.0.0.1:8000`.
- Verify WebSocket connection to `ws://127.0.0.1:8000/ws/chat` using a Python WebSocket client script.
- Verify JSON frame exchange (send test message, receive chat response payload).

### Manual & UI Verification
- Open `http://127.0.0.1:8000/` in browser.
- Verify status pill transitions from `Connecting...` to `Connected (WS)` with green dot.
- Send multiple test messages in chat: verify real-time response from backend via WebSocket.
- Restart/stop backend server: verify status pill changes to `Reconnecting...` / `Disconnected`.
- Restart backend server: verify frontend automatically reconnects without page refresh.
